> The same validations don't happen in minimal APIs because we don't execute any endpoints that invoke the cache initialization path.

@DamianEdwards forced this codepath to happen by calling the `GetUriByName` method

```
app.MapGet("/bar", () => "foo").WithName("Foo");
app.MapGet("/foo", (HttpContext context, LinkGenerator links) => links.GetUriByName(context, "foo", null)).WithName("Foo");
```
